7,GETTING TO KNOW: TENZIN CHOEGYAL - STREET TALK,https://thestreetcbr.wordpress.com/2024/03/26/getting-to-know-tenzin-choegyal/,"GETTING TO KNOW: TENZIN CHOEGYAL Singer-songwriter, activist and cultural ambassador Tenzin Choegyal is considered one of the world’s finest musicians in the Tibetan tradition. A son of Tibetan nomads, Tenzin feels a particular connection to the music of the wandering people of the Tibetan plateau.",Dzalakha,Sino-Tibetan
